# Everything is excluded except what the Dockerfile copies. A whitelist, for
# the same reason as the column audit in D2: a blacklist fails silently on the
# file nobody thought of, and the build context must never carry data or
# local state.
*
!requirements-serve.txt
!src/
!config/config.yaml
!config/reason_texts.yaml
!models/champion.json
**/__pycache__
